Package: NBAData
Type: Package
Title: Collect, Parse, Validate, and Store ESPN NBA Game Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kaleb", "Coleman", email = "kalebcoleman123@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects NBA game summaries from ESPN's public site API as raw
    JSON, parses them into game, team box score, player box score, and betting
    tables, validates row counts and keys, and writes the results to RDS, CSV,
    or a versioned SQLite database.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    httr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    janitor,
    lubridate,
    glue,
    purrr,
    tibble,
    magrittr,
    DBI,
    RSQLite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
